 epidemic in China spreads and the race for a cure intensifies.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qdBtHhstYUT5pW0XEl0H6bkoCBQ.jpg"}],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/np1jcUOCjTGpoIzKwCnV35zxu5B.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7hqf0VLmr5EaWJYXhjxgTrCUXl6.jpg","imdbRating":"7.0","runtime":"44 min","cast":["Mark-Paul Gosselaar","Saniyya Sidney","Caroline Chikezie","Vincent Piazza","Jamie McShane","Brianne Howey","Emmanuelle Chriqui","Zach Appelman"],"director":["Liz Heldens"],"released":"2019-01-14T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Can one girl save humanity?","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Liz Heldens","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yrPss9t78BJX3y7qPH51CWNCMZf.jpg"},{"name":"Mark-Paul Gosselaar","character":"Brad Wolgast","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6TbZu1RXaBu3gvwoPlNWBqFoqxw.jpg"},{"name":"Saniyya Sidney","character":"Amy Bellafonte","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3GO94ImDSWeFiBIkKpghkcjz0Fk.jpg"},{"name":"Caroline Chikezie","character":"Major Nickole Sykes","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eHTJu4aNZPAb8XBLHEM0hSqU9o6.jpg"},{"name":"Vincent Piazza","character":"Clark Richards","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cybUCnpnrvtfmJcF2vC2nBWzmKU.jpg"},{"name":"Jamie McShane","character":"Tim Fanning","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wojvRZMpAwytyoFTMFOpvZ26qJq.jpg"},{"name":"Brianne Howey","character":"Shauna Babcock","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cyy56FAt2mMWR4tWo53pIbw6eCk.jpg"},{"name":"Emmanuelle Chriqui","character":"Dr. Lila Kyle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2V1cPcR8IKc50tNxowvf5hRCJWi.jpg"},{"name":"Zach Appelman","character":"Agent Phil Doyle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tD9AxfDKkq8XheB95ZK2ep5Zkou.jpg"},{"name":"Tyler Barnhardt","character":"Jacob","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cDrvrH7vjiqbMJwe1hkj5ZeQHSc.jpg"},{"name":"Henry Ian Cusick","character":"Dr. Jonas Lear","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kgP